graph TB
    subgraph Input
        Freelancer[Freelancer]
        ProposalData[Proposal Data<br/>Cover Letter, Bid Amount]
        JobID[Job ID Reference]
    end

    subgraph P3_Proposal["Process 3.0: Proposal Management"]
        direction TB
        P3_1[3.1 Validate Job Exists]
        P3_2[3.2 Check User Not Client]
        P3_3[3.3 Generate Proposal ID]
        P3_4[3.4 Create Proposal Struct]
        P3_5[3.5 Store Proposal]
        P3_6[3.6 Link to Job]
        P3_7[3.7 Link to Freelancer]
        P3_8[3.8 Emit Event]
    end

    Freelancer -->|Submit| ProposalData
    JobID -->|Reference| P3_1
    ProposalData -->|Input| P3_1

    P3_1 -->|Valid Job| P3_2
    P3_2 -->|Is Freelancer| P3_3
    P3_3 -->|Proposal ID| P3_4
    P3_4 -->|Struct| P3_5
    P3_5 -->|Stored| P3_6
    P3_6 -->|Linked| P3_7
    P3_7 -->|Updated| P3_8

    P3_5 -->|Write| D3[(D3: Proposals)]
    P3_6 -->|Append| D6[(D6: Job Proposals)]
    P3_7 -->|Append| D7[(D7: Freelancer Proposals)]

    subgraph Approval["Approval Flow"]
        Client[Client]
        P3_9[3.9 Verify Job Owner]
        P3_10[3.10 Check Not Approved]
        P3_11[3.11 Mark Approved]
        P3_12[3.12 Call Hire Function]
    end

    D3 -->|Proposal Data| P3_9
    Client -->|Approve| P3_9
    P3_9 -->|Is Owner| P3_10
    P3_10 -->|Not Approved| P3_11
    P3_11 -->|Updated| P3_12
    P3_12 -->|Trigger| P2[Job Management<br/>Set Freelancer]